ge\" class=\"text-gray-800\">Kestrel 2P Ultralight</li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-gray-100\">\n<img alt=\"Kestrel 2P Ultralight tent pitched on a ridgeline at dawn\" class=\"aspect-square w-full object-cover\" id=\"ProductGalleryImage\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504280390367-361c6d9f38f4?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200\"/>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"mt-3 grid grid-cols-4 gap-3\">\n<li>\n<button aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-md aria-pressed:ring-2 aria-pressed:ring-emerald-700 aria-pressed:ring-offset-2\" data-gallery-alt=\"Kestrel 2P Ultralight tent pitched on a ridgeline at dawn\" data-gallery-image=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504280390367-361c6d9f38f4?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"sr-only\">Show ridgeline photo</span>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"aspect-square w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504280390367-361c6d9f38f4?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=200\"/>\n</button>\n</li>\n<li>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-md aria-pressed:ring-2 aria-pressed:ring-emerald-700 aria-pressed:ring-offset-2\" data-gallery-alt=\"Kestrel 2P Ultralight interior showing double-wall construction\" data-gallery-image=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1478131143081-80f7f84ca84d?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"sr-only\">Show interior photo</span>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"aspect-square w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1478131143081-80f7f84ca84d?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=200\"/>\n</button>\n</li>\n<li>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-md aria-pressed:ring-2 aria-pressed:ring-emerald-700 aria-pressed:ring-offset-2\" data-gallery-alt=\"Kestrel 2P Ultralight packed down into its stuff sack\" data-gallery-image=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1445308394109-4ec2920981b1?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"sr-only\">Show packed photo</span>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"aspect-square w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1445308394109-4ec2920981b1?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=200\"/>\n</button>\n</li>\n<li>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-md aria-pressed:ring-2 aria-pressed:ring-emerald-700 aria-pressed:ring-offset-2\" data-gallery-alt=\"Kestrel 2P Ultralight with the storm fly pitched in wind\" data-gallery-image=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487730116645-74489c95b41b?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"sr-only\">Show storm-fly photo</span>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"aspect-square w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487730116645-74489c95b41b?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=200\"/>\n</button>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl\">Kestrel 2P Ultralight</h1>\n<a class=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"#reviews\">\n<span class=\"flex items-center gap-0.5 text-amber-500\">\n<span class=\"sr-only\">Rated 4 out of 5 stars</span>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4 text-gray-200\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 underline underline-offset-2\">126 reviews</span>\n</a>\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900\">$389.00</p>\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">\n            A freestanding 2-person shelter built for three-season trips where every gram in the\n            pack has to earn its place. Double-wall construction sheds condensation without\n            sacrificing the 1.4kg trail weight.\n          </p>\n<div class=\"mt-6\">\n<p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-900\">\n              Colour: <span class=\"font-normal text-gray-600\">Moss green</span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n<button aria-label=\"Moss green\" class=\"size-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-700 ring-2 ring-emerald-700 ring-offset-2\" type=\"button\"></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Slate grey\" class=\"size-8 rounded-full bg-gray-500 ring-2 ring-transparent ring-offset-2 hover:ring-gray-300\" type=\"button\"></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Burnt orange\" class=\"size-8 rounded-full bg-orange-600 ring-2 ring-transparent ring-offset-2 hover:ring-gray-300\" type=\"button\"></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-end gap-4\">\n<div>\n<label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-900\" for=\"Quantity\">Quantity</label>\n<div class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-1\">\n<button class=\"size-10 leading-10 text-gray-600 transition hover:opacity-75\" type=\"button\">\n                  −\n                </button>\n<input class=\"h-10 w-16 rounded-md border-gray-300 text-center sm:text-sm\" id=\"Quantity\" type=\"number\" value=\"1\"/>\n<button class=\"size-10 leading-10 text-gray-600 transition hover:opacity-75\" type=\"button\">\n                  +\n                </button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<button class=\"flex-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-emerald-800\" type=\"button\">\n              Add to cart\n            </button>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-2 border-t border-gray-200 pt-6 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4 text-emerald-700\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n              In stock — ships within 2 business days\n            </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4 text-emerald-700\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n              Free returns within 30 days\n            </li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-16\">\n<div class=\"border-b border-gray-200\">\n<div class=\"-mb-px flex gap-6\" role=\"tablist\">\n<button aria-controls=\"description\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"border-b-2 py-3 text-sm font-medium aria-selected:border-emerald-700 aria-selected:text-emerald-700 aria-[selected=false]:border-transparent aria-[selected=false]:text-gray-500 aria-[selected=false]:hover:text-gray-700\" id=\"tab-description\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n              Description\n            </button>\n<button aria-controls=\"shipping\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"border-b-2 py-3 text-sm font-medium aria-selected:border-emerald-700 aria-selected:text-emerald-700 aria-[selected=false]:border-transparent aria-[selected=false]:text-gray-500 aria-[selected=false]:hover:text-gray-700\" id=\"tab-shipping\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">\n              Shipping &amp; returns\n            </button>\n<button aria-controls=\"reviews\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"border-b-2 py-3 text-sm font-medium aria-selected:border-emerald-700 aria-selected:text-emerald-700 aria-[selected=false]:border-transparent aria-[selected=false]:text-gray-500 aria-[selected=false]:hover:text-gray-700\" id=\"tab-reviews\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">\n              Reviews (126)\n            </button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"tab-description\" class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-gray-600\" id=\"description\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<p>\n            The Kestrel uses a single-hub aluminium pole set that pitches in under four minutes,\n            even with cold hands. Colour-coded clips and a symmetrical fly mean there's only one way\n            to get it wrong, and it's hard to.\n          </p>\n<ul class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm\">\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-500\">Packed weight</span> · 1.4kg</li>\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-500\">Floor area</span> · 2.7m²</li>\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-500\">Peak height</span> · 104cm</li>\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-500\">Season rating</span> · 3-season</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"tab-shipping\" class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-gray-600\" hidden=\"\" id=\"shipping\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<p>\n            Ships within 2 business days from our EU and US warehouses. Free returns within 30 days\n            if it hasn't been pitched outside — unused, tags on, original packaging.\n          </p>\n<ul class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm\">\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-500\">Delivery</span> · 2–4 business days</li>\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-500\">Returns window</span> · 30 days</li>\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-500\">Warranty</span> · 2 years</li>\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-500\">Repair kit</span> · Included</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"tab-reviews\" class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl scroll-mt-20\" hidden=\"\" id=\"reviews\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">Reviews</h2>\n<span class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">4.6 average from 126 reviews</span>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-4\">\n<li class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-0.5 text-amber-500\">\n<span class=\"sr-only\">Rated 4 out of 5 stars</span>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L